              <l xml:id="b01_h001_02_lubotsky_a">agníḥ pū́rvebhiḥ ŕ̥ṣibhiḥ</l>
              <l xml:id="b01_h001_02_lubotsky_b">ī́ḍyaḥ nū́tanaiḥ utá</l>
              <l xml:id="b01_h001_02_lubotsky_c">sá devā́n ā́ ihá vakṣati</l>
            </lg>
            <lg xml:id="b01_h001_02_vnh" xml:lang="san-Latn-x-ISO-15919" source="vnh">
              <l xml:id="b01_h001_02_vnh_a">agníḥ pū́rvebhir ŕ̥ṣibhir</l>
              <l xml:id="b01_h001_02_vnh_b">ī́ḍiyo nū́tanair utá</l>
              <l xml:id="b01_h001_02_vnh_c">sá devā́m̐ éhá vakṣati</l>
            </lg>
            <lg xml:id="b01_h001_02_aufrecht" xml:lang="san-Latn-x-ISO-15919" source="aufrecht">
              <l xml:id="b01_h001_02_aufrecht_a">agníḥ pū́rvebhir ŕ̥ṣibhir ī́ḍyo nū́tanair utá</l>
              <l xml:id="b01_h001_02_aufrecht_c">sá devā́m̐ éhá vakṣati</l>
            </lg>
            <lg xml:id="b01_h001_02_padapatha" xml:lang="san-Latn-x-ISO-15919" source="padapatha">
              <l xml:id="b01_h001_02_padapatha_0" xml:lang="san-Latn-x-ISO-15919">
                <w xml:id="b01_h001_02_padapatha_0_01">agniḥ</w>
                <w xml:id="b01_h001_02_padapatha_0_02">pūrvebhiḥ</w>
                <w xml:id="b01_h001_02_padapatha_0_03">r̥ṣi-bhiḥ</w>
                <w xml:id="b01_h001_02_padapatha_0_04">īḍyaḥ</w>
                <w xml:id="b01_h001_02_padapatha_0_05">nūtanaiḥ</w>
                <w xml:id="b01_h001_02_padapatha_0_06">uta</w>
                <w xml:id="b01_h001_02_padapatha_0_07">saḥ</w>
                <w xml:id="b01_h001_02_padapatha_0_08">devān</w>
                <w xml:id="b01_h001_02_padapatha_0_09">ā</w>
                <w xml:id="b01_h001_02_padapatha_0_10">iha</w>
                <w xml:id="b01_h001_02_padapatha_0_11">vakṣati</w>
              </l>
            </lg>
            <lg xml:id="b01_h001_02_eichler" xml:lang="san-Deva" source="eichler">
              <l xml:id="b01_h001_02_eichler_a">अ॒ग्निः पूर्वे॑भि॒र्ऋषि॑भि॒रीड्यो॒ नूत॑नैरु॒त</l>
              <l xml:id="b01_h001_02_eichler_c">स दे॒वाँ एह व॑क्षति</l>
            </lg>
            <lg xml:id="b01_h001_02_geldner" xml:lang="deu" source="geldner">
              <l xml:id="b01_h001_02_geldner_0" xml:lang="deu">Agni war von den früheren R̥ṣis und ist von den jüngsten zu berufen; er möge die Götter hierher fahren.</l>
            </lg>
            <lg xml:id="b01_h001_02_grassmann" xml:lang="deu" source="grassmann">
              <l xml:id="b01_h001_02_grassmann_0" xml:lang="deu">Der von der alten Sängerschar, von neuen auch zu preisen ist, Die Götter fahr uns Agni her.</l>
            </lg>
            <lg xml:id="b01_h001_02_griffith" xml:lang="eng" source="griffith">
              <l xml:id="b01_h001_02_griffith_0" xml:lang="eng">Worthy is Agni to be praised by living as by ancient seers. He shall bring hitherward the Gods.</l>
            </lg>
            <lg xml:id="b01_h001_02_macdonell" xml:lang="eng" source="macdonell">
              <l xml:id="b01_h001_02_macdonell_0" xml:lang="eng">Agni is worthy to be praised, By present as by seers of old: May he to us conduct the gods.</l>
            </lg>
            <lg xml:id="b01_h001_02_oldenberg" xml:lang="eng" source="oldenberg">
              <l xml:id="b01_h001_02_oldenberg_0" xml:lang="eng">Agni, worthy to be magnified by the ancient Rishis and by the present ones — may he conduct the gods hither.</l>
            </lg>
            <lg xml:id="b01_h001_02_renou" xml:lang="fra" source="renou">
              <l xml:id="b01_h001_02_renou_0" xml:lang="fra">Agni est digne d'être invoqué par les Prophètes antiques ainsi que par ceux de maintenant:/ qu'il convoie les dieux ici!</l>
            </lg>
            <lg xml:id="b01_h001_02_elizarenkova" xml:lang="rus" source="elizarenkova">
              <l xml:id="b01_h001_02_elizarenkova_1">Агни достоин призываний риши –</l>
              <l xml:id="b01_h001_02_elizarenkova_2">Как прежних, так и нынешних:</l>
              <l xml:id="b01_h001_02_elizarenkova_3">Да привезет он сюда богов!</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="b01_h002" ana="2" type="hymn">
