            </lg>
            <lg xml:id="b01_h002_01_vnh" xml:lang="san-Latn-x-ISO-15919" source="vnh">
              <l xml:id="b01_h002_01_vnh_a">vā́yav ā́ yāhi darśata</l>
              <l xml:id="b01_h002_01_vnh_b">imé sómā áraṁkr̥tāḥ</l>
              <l xml:id="b01_h002_01_vnh_c">téṣām pāhi śrudhī́ hávam</l>
            </lg>
            <lg xml:id="b01_h002_01_aufrecht" xml:lang="san-Latn-x-ISO-15919" source="aufrecht">
              <l xml:id="b01_h002_01_aufrecht_a">vā́yav ā́ yāhi darśatemé sómā áraṁkr̥tāḥ</l>
              <l xml:id="b01_h002_01_aufrecht_c">téṣām pāhi śrudhī́ hávam</l>
            </lg>
            <lg xml:id="b01_h002_01_padapatha" xml:lang="san-Latn-x-ISO-15919" source="padapatha">
              <l xml:id="b01_h002_01_padapatha_0" xml:lang="san-Latn-x-ISO-15919">
                <w xml:id="b01_h002_01_padapatha_0_01">vāyo iti</w>
                <w xml:id="b01_h002_01_padapatha_0_02">ā</w>
                <w xml:id="b01_h002_01_padapatha_0_03">yāhi</w>
                <w xml:id="b01_h002_01_padapatha_0_04">darśata</w>
                <w xml:id="b01_h002_01_padapatha_0_05">ime</w>
                <w xml:id="b01_h002_01_padapatha_0_06">somāḥ</w>
                <w xml:id="b01_h002_01_padapatha_0_07">araṁ-kr̥tāḥ</w>
                <w xml:id="b01_h002_01_padapatha_0_08">teṣām</w>
                <w xml:id="b01_h002_01_padapatha_0_09">pāhi</w>
                <w xml:id="b01_h002_01_padapatha_0_10">śrudhi</w>
                <w xml:id="b01_h002_01_padapatha_0_11">havam</w>
              </l>
            </lg>
            <lg xml:id="b01_h002_01_eichler" xml:lang="san-Deva" source="eichler">
              <l xml:id="b01_h002_01_eichler_a">वाय॒वा या॑हि दर्शते॒मे सोमा॒ अरं॑कृताः</l>
              <l xml:id="b01_h002_01_eichler_c">तेषां॑ पाहि श्रु॒धी हव॑म्</l>
            </lg>
            <lg xml:id="b01_h002_01_geldner" xml:lang="deu" source="geldner">
              <l xml:id="b01_h002_01_geldner_0" xml:lang="deu">Vāyu! Komm her, du Gerngesehener; diese Somasäfte sind fertig. Trink davon, erhöre den Ruf!</l>
            </lg>
            <lg xml:id="b01_h002_01_grassmann" xml:lang="deu" source="grassmann">
              <l xml:id="b01_h002_01_grassmann_0" xml:lang="deu">O schöner Vaju, komm herbei, die Somatränke stehn bereit; Von diesen trinke, hör den Ruf.</l>
            </lg>
            <lg xml:id="b01_h002_01_griffith" xml:lang="eng" source="griffith">
              <l xml:id="b01_h002_01_griffith_0" xml:lang="eng">BEAUTIFUL Vâyu, come, for thee these Soma drops have been prepared: Drink of them, hearken to our call.</l>
            </lg>
            <lg xml:id="b01_h002_01_mueller" xml:lang="eng" source="mueller">
              <l xml:id="b01_h002_01_mueller_0" xml:lang="eng">Come hither, O Vâyu, thou beautiful one 1! These Somas are ready, drink of them, hear our call!</l>
            </lg>
            <lg xml:id="b01_h002_01_renou" xml:lang="fra" source="renou">
              <l xml:id="b01_h002_01_renou_0" xml:lang="fra">O Vāyu, arrive, ô (dieu) beau à voir! Ces soma-ci (sont) à disposition:/ bois en; écoute l'appel (aux dieux)!</l>
            </lg>
            <lg xml:id="b01_h002_01_elizarenkova" xml:lang="rus" source="elizarenkova">
              <l xml:id="b01_h002_01_elizarenkova_1">O Ваю, приди, приятный для глаз,</l>
              <l xml:id="b01_h002_01_elizarenkova_2">Эти соки сомы приготовлены.</l>
              <l xml:id="b01_h002_01_elizarenkova_3">Испей их, услышь призыв!</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
  </text>
